config IR_SPI_XIAOMI
	tristate "SPI connected IR LED, Xiaomi buffer size"
	depends on SPI && LIRC && OF
	help
	  The upstream ir-spi driver (IR blaster LED on SPI) built as a vendor
	  module with a 32 KiB transmit buffer: the 4 KiB upstream limit is too
	  small for the IR codes Xiaomi's remote app sends. GKI does not build
	  ir-spi, so ingres ships this copy instead.
